  "content": "<table style=\"width:97.8049%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/req_sodium.png\" alt=\"需要 Sodium\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_modmenu.png\" alt=\"與 Mod Menu 相容\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_iris.png\" alt=\"與 Iris Shaders 相容\" width=\"150\"> </a></td>\n<td style=\"width:19.6005%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/works_sinytra.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:5px;width:20.0999%\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optifabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/main/readme-assets/crashes_opti.png\" alt=\"與 Optifabric 衝突\" width=\"150\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fPbPhrQNSz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1052166699924856852?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=informational&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fchunks-fade-in\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-協助翻譯-blue?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>描述</h2><p>此模組為區塊載入添加了平滑的淡入與動畫效果，類似於 Minecraft 基岩版和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-animator\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChunkAnimator</a>，並包含其他獨特功能。它能與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>、（大部分）<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdistanthorizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a> 以及（大部分）<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris</a> 無縫協作。從此區塊不再憑空出現在你面前！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>支援的 Minecraft 版本</h4><ul>\n<li>1.18.x</li>\n<li>1.19.x</li>\n<li>1.20.x</li>\n<li>1.21.x</li>\n</ul><h4>積極維護的版本（可能擴展）</h4><ul>\n<li>1.20.1 (LTS)</li>\n<li>1.21.1 (LTS)</li>\n<li>1.21.6-1.21.8</li>\n<li>1.21.9-1.21.10</li>\n<li>1.21.11</li>\n</ul><h4>支援的模組載入器</h4><ul>\n<li>Fabric/Quilt（全部）</li>\n<li>NeoForge (1.21+)</li>\n<li>Forge (1.20.1)</li>\n</ul><h4>依賴項目（可能與其他版本相容）</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.5.13 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a> 0.3.31 - 1.20.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.6.13 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a> 1.0.15 - 1.21.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.7.3 - 1.21.6-1.21.10</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 0.8.2 - 1.21.11</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>功能特色</h3><h4>展示影片</h4><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8QDTzGK01ls\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h4>靈活的設定，支援 Mod Menu！</h4><p><img src=\"https://github.com/kerudion/chunksfadein/raw/main/readme-assets/config.png?raw=true\" width=\"590\" height=\"533\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
